{
  "description": "Phase 3.2 D-07: one case file for every entry point of validateLanguageSettings (app settings.ts, scripts/init-env.js, scripts/config-server.js). context.reranker and context.embeddingProfile are {id, supportedLanguages} or null; context.registryChange edits one shipped pack the way tests/fixtures/rag/language-pack-completeness-cases.json does. expect.settings is what getLanguageSettings() returns for the same two raw values.",
  "cases": [
